      en: ["The only province of Equatorial Guinea in the Southern Hemisphere.", "Discovered by Portuguese navigators on January 1, 1471.", "Home to the crater lake Lago A Pot, also known as Lake Mazafin.", "The island was named 'Ano Bom' (Good Year) due to its discovery date.", "Critical habitat for the endemic Annobón white-eye and paradise flycatcher.", "Features steep volcanic cliffs and black sand beaches."],
