      en: ["Protects approximately 700 square kilometers of wilderness.", "Located in the remote southeastern hills of Rio Muni.", "Provides a vital refuge for chimpanzees and other primates.", "Characterized by high-altitude tropical forest ecosystems.", "Important hydrological catchment for the Wele River system.", "A key site for national and regional biodiversity conservation.", "One of the least explored and most pristine parks in the country."],
